{#-
  SHARED legal-page body — Privacy Policy.

  Canonical source: eau_claire_tree/src/_shared/_includes/privacy-policy-body.njk
  This file is part of the shared design system and MUST stay byte-identical
  across all 3 Rick-Olson microsite repos (stump / trim / removals).

  DO NOT use ~/.hermes/scripts/sync-shared.sh for this file — that script
  rsyncs the whole _shared/ tree with --delete, which would clobber the
  removals-specific canonical fix in eau_claire_tree_removals'
  src/_shared/_includes/base.njk. Copy this file into each sister repo
  individually instead (see hub RUNBOOK.md §18).

  Context available (passed in from the calling page's front matter):
    site.name                    per-site brand name
    site.footer.parentBrandName  "Eau Claire Tree Service"
    site.footer.parentBrandUrl   parent site URL
    site.phone / site.phoneE164
    site.email
    site.address.display
    legalScope        front matter — the services this site covers
    legalUpdated      front matter — human-readable "Last updated" date

  CONTENT RULE: every statement below was verified against the live sites
  on 2026-10-27. The three microsites have NO contact forms, NO analytics,
  NO tracking cookies, NO ad pixels, NO chat widgets, NO iframes, and NO
  payment integrations. The only outside asset load is Google Fonts; the
  only host is Cloudflare Pages. If any of that ever changes, update this
